  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeNo1MemberOfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주1) 임직원 복지와 관련된 직원들의 금융기관 대출금에 대하여 제공한 채무보증입니다. 동 종업원 금융기관대출 등과 관련하여 연결회사의 예금 및 적금 15,608백만원이 담보로 제공되어 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeNo2MemberOfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주2) 해당 보증금액은 지급보증 한도를 포함하고 있으며, 당반기말 현재 대출 피보증인의 대출 실행잔액은 825백만원 입니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ReceivedPaymentGuaranteeNo1MemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보증수익자는 금융결제원, 근로복지공단 등 입니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ReceivedPaymentGuaranteeNo2MemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">보증수익자는 서울아레나입니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_dart_ReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMember" xml:lang="ko">보증수익자는 근로복지공단 등입니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ProvidedPaymentGuarantee1MemberOfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">임직원 복지와 관련된 직원들의 금융기관 대출금 2,000백만원에 대하여 채무보증을 제공하고 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ProvidedPaymentGuarantee2MemberOfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">동 종업원 금융기관 대출 등과 관련하여 회사의 예금 및 적금 2,200백만원이 담보로 제공되어 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeNo1MemberOfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주1) 임직원 복지와 관련된 직원들의 금융기관 대출금에 대하여 제공한 채무보증입니다. 동 종업원 금융기관대출 등과 관련하여 연결회사의 예금 및 적금 15,847백만원이 담보로 제공되어 있습니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
  <dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity00258801_ProvidedPaymentGuaranteeNo2MemberOfProvidedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesNonPFTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주2) 해당 보증금액은 지급보증 한도를 포함하고 있으며, 전기말 현재 대출 피보증인의 대출 실행잔액은 2,760백만원 입니다.</dart:RemarksCommentsAboutGuarantee>
