  <ifrs-full:AdditionalInformationAboutSharebasedPaymentArrangements contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00258801_Five0ThShareBasedPaymentArrangementMemberOfOptionalAndEquitySettledShareOptionsOfDisclosureOfNumberAndWeightedAverageExercisePricesOfShareOptionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주1)당반기 자사주 소각에 따른 부여수량 및 행사가격 조정분이 반영되었습니다.</ifrs-full:AdditionalInformationAboutSharebasedPaymentArrangements>
