  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfTermsAndConditionsOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00258801_KakaoEnterpriseCorpOfSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주1) ㈜카카오엔터프라이즈에 대한 기타채권은 대여금이 포함되어 있으며, 해당 대여금은 4,750백만원입니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfTermsAndConditionsOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfTermsAndConditionsOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00258801_KakaoHealthcareCorpOfAssociatesMemberOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주2) ㈜카카오헬스케어에 대한 기타채권 중 대여금 6,000백만원은 회수되었습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfTermsAndConditionsOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfTermsAndConditionsOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="PFY2025dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00258801_DearuCoLtdOfSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransactionsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">(주1) 전기 중 관계기업에서 종속기업으로 재분류 되었습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfTermsAndConditionsOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
